      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ENJOY LIFE (12) is a progressive colt who went through his first campaign unbeaten in five appearances, last seen when getting home by 6m at Launceston in March. Tricky draw but hails from a leading yard that will have him ready to go after a second to a Group 1 winner at the trials. HITCH TO HIS STAR (9) is racing well having placed in both outings since overcoming a wide draw to score at Wagga. Draws on the back line but is suited dropping to a distance where he is yet to miss a place in nine tries, winning six. HIGHLANDHARTBREAKA (2) gets his best draw for some time and that could see him competitive while ROYAL APPOINTMENT (1) was runner-up from this barrier here two back so can get into the finish.",
